  "body": "You can't pass by looking at this outstanding Castor Bay offering;\r\n\r\nSeriously motivated Vendor - reluctant sale but must be sold.\r\n\r\n- FREEHOLD title\r\n- Master Build Guarantee\r\n- Positioned in prime Castor Bay street\r\n- Easy care living\r\n- Set quietly off the road\r\n- Walk to beaches, Milford shopping and Marina\r\n- Well designed offering spacious and light filled living\r\n- Great investment property\r\n\r\nZoned for Campbells Bay Primary, Murrays Bay and Wairau Intermediate, and both Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools, with excellent Catholic schools also nearby.\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, downsizing or simply changing pace, this is the kind of property that quietly fits around your lifestyle rather than demanding your time.\r\n\r\nTo download property documents please copy and paste this link in your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/N213",
